\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Per-cell-type descriptive robustness summaries. (A) Brain full-confound rows by readout. (B) PBMC full-confound rows by readout. (C) Earlier brain per-type co-expression, Geneformer- embedding, and Geneformer-attention summaries on the same fixed panel. (D) Cell counts underlying the per-type rows. These observed effects have no randomization $p$-values, multiplicity claims, or population-uncertainty interpretation.}}{13}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
